        "original_id": "3cafb74d-fbf5-5fa2-afda-9221a6ecfc8e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Atlantic City, New Jersey, Boardwalk\n- Companies: Colony Capital\n- Products: The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel, Golden Nugget Hotel & Casino, Trump Plaza Hotel and Casino, Dunes Hotel and Casino\n- People: Martin Stern, Jr.\n\nFacts:\n- Trump Plaza Hotel and Casino was designed by architect Martin Stern, Jr.\n- Trump Plaza Hotel and Casino operated from May 15, 1984 until September 16, 2014.\n- The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel was formerly known as Golden Nugget, Bally's Grand, Atlantic City Hilton, and ACH.\n- The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel was a casino and hotel at the southern end of the Boardwalk in Atlantic City, New Jersey.\n- Colony Capital owned and operated The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel.\n- The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel permanently closed on January 13, 2014, at 12:01 AM.\n- Dunes Hotel and Casino was planned to be the southernmost hotel and casino on the Boardwalk, adjacent to the Golden Nugget Hotel & Casino.",
